FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM golang:1.26.7-alpine3.23@sha256:b17af760035fc2f338eed92d448a6c67f2d45438844fc6c60678fa5f99e44b57 AS build
WORKDIR /src
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN go mod download
COPY . .
ARG VERSION=dev
ARG TARGETOS
ARG TARGETARCH
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=$TARGETOS GOARCH=$TARGETARCH go build -trimpath -ldflags="-s -w -X main.version=${VERSION}" -o /out/tailbridge ./cmd/tailbridge

FROM gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot@sha256:afa5c872c891853ca7fcf1f12c3edb23f7eeef36189728842dd51042ff57f7ab
COPY --from=build /out/tailbridge /tailbridge
USER nonroot:nonroot
ENTRYPOINT ["/tailbridge"]
